WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:12.090
When we realized that the determination of
sex and gender in humans is controlled by

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:22.320
issues like the X and Y chromosomes, and that
in some societies people actively decide on

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:29.300
whether they want sons and daughters, we could
change the models that told us about the evolution

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:38.820
of sex and gender to include the cultural
transmission of preference for sons and daughters.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:47.440
And that led us to ask some data questions
about how that preference is manifested, how

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:53.060
it's related to marriage customs and what
the long-term demographic consequences would be.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:01:03.480
And that led to a whole series of mathematical,
quantitative models for the evolution of the sex ratio.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.920
And we in particular applied it to the Chinese
population.

